\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Disjunctive TWSS evaluated on the DTN synthetic adversaries with the default tuning ($\beta {=}1.5$, $\gamma {=}0.5$, $w_w{=}0.6$, $\delta {=}4$). The consistent oracle now properly hits $1.000$ due to the $Z$-normalisation, and the adversaries creating conflicting plans (e.g. Oracle first option, Conflict-prone, Wrong-skill) are heavily punished on their task score component via local $C_i$ while maintaining independent wait scores.\relax }}{12}{table.caption.30}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:dtn-adversaries}{{4}{12}{Disjunctive TWSS evaluated on the DTN synthetic adversaries with the default tuning ($\beta {=}1.5$, $\gamma {=}0.5$, $w_w{=}0.6$, $\delta {=}4$). The consistent oracle now properly hits $1.000$ due to the $Z$-normalisation, and the adversaries creating conflicting plans (e.g. Oracle first option, Conflict-prone, Wrong-skill) are heavily punished on their task score component via local $C_i$ while maintaining independent wait scores.\relax }{table.caption.30}{}}
